    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Over 250 residents of Nakawa Division received free health services during a medical camp organized by the Aga Khan University (AKU), in partnership with the Aga Khan University Hospital. Held on July 11, 2025, at the University's newly constructed Nakawa campus, the initiative was part of an Open Day designed to connect with the community and future students.",
